     "\r\n<font face=\"georgia\" size=\"2\"><p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:georgia;font-size:10pt\"><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Hi all,</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:georgia;font-size:10pt\"> </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:1.25em 0px;padding:0px;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;border:0px solid rgb(217,217,227);box-sizing:border-box;font-family:SÃƒÂ¶hne,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Ubuntu,Cantarell,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;white-space:pre-wrap\">There are the last 4 seats available for our &quot;Introduction to R Shiny&quot; workshop on January 29-30, 2024 – an immersive online experience for R users.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:georgia;font-size:10pt\"> </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:1.25em 0px;padding:0px;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;border:0px solid rgb(217,217,227);box-sizing:border-box;font-family:SÃƒÂ¶hne,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Ubuntu,Cantarell,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;white-space:pre-wrap\"> </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:georgia;font-size:10pt\"> </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:1.25em 0px;padding:0px;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;border:0px solid rgb(217,217,227);box-sizing:border-box;font-family:SÃƒÂ¶hne,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Ubuntu,Cantarell,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;white-space:pre-wrap\">Course website: <a title=\"This external link will open in a new window\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.physalia-courses.org/courses-workshops/shiny/\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.physalia-courses.org/courses-workshops/shiny/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792387061470000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2M2nN80ZebJTdmC_Nk4fG8\">https://www.physalia-courses.org/courses-workshops/shiny/</a></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:georgia;font-size:10pt\"> </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:1.25em 0px;padding:0px;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;border:0px solid rgb(217,217,227);box-sizing:border-box;font-family:SÃƒÂ¶hne,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Ubuntu,Cantarell,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;white-space:pre-wrap\">Join us to discover how Shiny goes beyond being just an R package, evolving into a powerful framework that empowers users to create responsive web applications. Dive deep into fundamental principles and leave confidently equipped to craft sophisticated web apps directly from within R.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:georgia;font-size:10pt\"> </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:1.25em 0px;padding:0px;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;border:0px solid rgb(217,217,227);box-sizing:border-box;font-family:SÃƒÂ¶hne,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Ubuntu,Cantarell,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;white-space:pre-wrap\"><strong style=\"border:0px solid rgb(217,217,227);box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:600\">Prerequisites:</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:georgia;font-size:10pt\"> </p>\r\n<ul style=\"font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;border:0px solid rgb(217,217,227);box-sizing:border-box;list-style:outside;margin:1.25em 0px;padding:0px;display:flex;font-family:Söhne,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Ubuntu,Cantarell,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;white-space:pre-wrap\"><li style=\"border:0px solid rgb(217,217,227);box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding-left:0.375em;display:block;min-height:28px\">- Basic proficiency in R required</li><li style=\"border:0px solid rgb(217,217,227);box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding-left:0.375em;display:block;min-height:28px\">- Some knowledge of dplyr and ggplot2 beneficial</li><li style=\"border:0px solid rgb(217,217,227);box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding-left:0.375em;display:block;min-height:28px\">- Familiarity with RStudio IDE preferable</li><li style=\"border:0px solid rgb(217,217,227);box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding-left:0.375em;display:block;min-height:28px\">- No prior knowledge of HTML, CSS, or JavaScript required</li></ul><p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:georgia;font-size:10pt\"> </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:1.25em 0px;padding:0px;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;border:0px solid rgb(217,217,227);box-sizing:border-box;font-family:SÃƒÂ¶hne,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Ubuntu,Cantarell,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;white-space:pre-wrap\"><strong style=\"border:0px solid rgb(217,217,227);box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:600\">Outcomes:</strong> After the workshop, you&#39;ll:</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:georgia;font-size:10pt\"> </p>\r\n<ul style=\"font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;border:0px solid rgb(217,217,227);box-sizing:border-box;list-style:outside;margin:1.25em 0px;padding:0px;display:flex;font-family:Söhne,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Ubuntu,Cantarell,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;white-space:pre-wrap\"><li style=\"border:0px solid rgb(217,217,227);box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding-left:0.375em;display:block;min-height:28px\">- Understand Shiny app structure</li><li style=\"border:0px solid rgb(217,217,227);box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding-left:0.375em;display:block;min-height:28px\">- Read and comprehend Shiny app code</li><li style=\"border:0px solid rgb(217,217,227);box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding-left:0.375em;display:block;min-height:28px\">- Have a solid grasp of Shiny reactivity concepts</li><li style=\"border:0px solid rgb(217,217,227);box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding-left:0.375em;display:block;min-height:28px\">- Create and deploy a Shiny app on <a href=\"http://shinyapps.io\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shinyapps.io&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792387061470000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3hNlmjpdY9MpQ4DhAYP2jL\">shinyapps.io</a></li></ul><p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:georgia;font-size:10pt\"> </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:georgia;font-size:10pt\">For the full list of our courses and workshops, please have a look at: <a style=\"font-family:Söhne,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,Roboto,Ubuntu,Cantarell,&quot;Noto Sans&quot;,sans-serif,&quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;,Arial,&quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;,&quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;font-size:16px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:pre-wrap;word-spacing:0px\" title=\"This external link will open in a new window\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://www.physalia-courses.org/courses-workshops/shiny/\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.physalia-courses.org/courses-workshops/shiny/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792387061470000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2M2nN80ZebJTdmC_Nk4fG8\">https://www.physalia-courses.org/courses-workshops/</a></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:georgia;font-size:10pt\"> </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:georgia;font-size:10pt\"> </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:georgia;font-size:10pt\"> </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;font-family:georgia;font-size:10pt\">Best regards,</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px;paddi